  m_text: "1) Press Play and see how the character reacts to the real-time AudioSource!\n\n2)
    Notice the moving Target \u2013 the character's head and eyes will automatically
    track it using the IK system.\n\n3) Select \"Model\" in the Hierarchy to see
    the FaceSync Controller component.\n\n4) Experiment with the IK Look Tracking
    settings (Smooth Speed, Max Angle, Influence) to see how the tracking behavior
    changes.\n\n5) Feel free to change the audio clip or play with the viseme mappings!"
